<!--
  The app (and its launcher): hardened runtime with no exceptions. No App
  Sandbox: the app runs the administrator step, launchctl and reads
  /Library/Application Support, none of which a sandboxed app may do
  (docs/plans/macos-app.md 10.2). Apple events are not needed: do shell
  script runs in osascript, which sends none to other apps.
-->
